#: extension/home-assistant@maximeallanic.github.io/prefs-companion.js:34
msgid ""
"This computer becomes a device of the Mobile App integration: it reports "
"sensors (battery, volume, screen lock, media playing…), receives commands "
"and shows notifications sent from Home Assistant."
msgstr ""
"Cet ordinateur devient un appareil de l’intégration Mobile App : il remonte "
"des capteurs (batterie, volume, verrouillage de l’écran, média en cours…), "
"reçoit des commandes et affiche les notifications envoyées par Home "
"Assistant."

