#: extension/home-assistant@maximeallanic.github.io/prefs-companion.js:54
#: extension/home-assistant@maximeallanic.github.io/prefs-companion.js:76
msgid "Home Assistant package"
msgstr "Paquet Home Assistant"

#: extension/home-assistant@maximeallanic.github.io/prefs-companion.js:55
msgid ""
"Turns the sensors of this computer into controls (volume and brightness "
"sliders, switches, buttons, scripts). In Home Assistant, enable packages in "
"configuration.yaml (homeassistant: packages: !include_dir_named packages), "
"save this text as packages/gnome_computer.yaml, then restart Home Assistant."
msgstr ""
"Transforme les capteurs de cet ordinateur en commandes (curseurs de volume "
"et de luminosité, interrupteurs, boutons, scripts). Dans Home Assistant, "
"activez les paquets dans configuration.yaml (homeassistant: packages: !"
"include_dir_named packages), enregistrez ce texte sous packages/"
"gnome_computer.yaml, puis redémarrez Home Assistant."

